sequenceDiagram
  title Sign-in with a token
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as Auth service
  participant D as User DB
  U->>W: Enter email and password
  W->>A: POST /login
  A->>D: Look up user
  D-->>A: User record
  Note over A: Compares the password hash
  alt credentials valid
    A-->>W: Session token
    W-->>U: Show dashboard
  else invalid
    A-->>W: 401 Unauthorised
  end
